# Terraform runtime data and local secrets
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars

# Keep documented examples and provider lock files in Git
!**/*.tfvars.example

# Runtime environment secret files
**/*.env
!**/*.env.example

# Python-generated cache and bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
